        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/Dockerfile#L24-L35",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e8dea219d342d454ef3c3f84deea268d8f49e565b66584f6206a005d72720754:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_385f464f78c94a9cace36c4b05aa0287",
      "statement": "The image sets PORT to 8000 and records its version in FRAME_TV_VERSION from the APP_VERSION build argument.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/Dockerfile#L39-L45",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3e385eab41e3986c2130fc6b25a94dd2be8355e67165f9433d5b1e73f24b040d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_19e4b65bfe6047f1a5bd98de30162fd2",
      "statement": "The container starts through an entrypoint that migrates the database, then runs gunicorn with four workers by default and a 180 second timeout kept above the upload deadline, so one unresponsive TV cannot freeze the app and a slow upload is not killed by gunicorn.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/Dockerfile#L51-L56",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3a85538385f3a722e22ecc39c20dd2e5fbb90daa9f6858956f65b80892c9dd22:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_31e24bc18dc94df78d997135b63a9cb1",
      "statement": "The compose file mounts one named volume at /data with FRAME_TV_DATA set to /data, so uploads, database and caches survive an image update.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://backend/docker-compose.yml#L21-L21",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:485e92c95248606214fc1802ff79aa0e77ed4cd4e4a918ad2ff9a2b371b5eb70:"
        },
        {
