        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b3ef4c20c5bc4391902f2dfdd40cbcf0",
      "statement": "On every push to main the release workflow runs release-please with the simple release type, and when a release is created it explicitly calls the image build workflow with the new tag, because a release created with the workflow token does not trigger other workflows.",
